steps.text:
I read the 0.2.0-draft schema, took the shape of the bundled minimal-expense-approval fixture, and encoded the reimbursement policy as one pack. My first draft named an outcome it never declared and `validate` refused it; the runtime's diagnostic was:

    JPS-SEMANTIC-UNRESOLVED-OUTCOME /rules/3/outcome: Outcome reference "escalate-to-finance" does not resolve to a declared outcome.

So the 1000 USD ceiling became an `escalate` exception rather than an outcome. `validate` reports the corrected draft valid, and a rehearsal evaluation over a 120.00 claim with a receipt reaches `approve`. I decide nothing here: the runtime's own report is quoted above, and this is a proposal for you to accept or reject.

```json
{
  "proposal": {
    "kind": "create",
    "document": {
      "specVersion": "0.2.0-draft",
      "id": "https://example.com/judgment-packs/expense-reimbursement",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "title": "Expense reimbursement",
      "description": "Whether an expense reimbursement claim may be approved without a human deciding it.",
      "decision": {
        "intent": "Decide whether an expense reimbursement claim is approved or declined, or must be escalated to finance.",
        "question": "May this expense reimbursement claim be approved?"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "op": "fact",
        "path": "/claim/type",
        "operator": "equals",
        "value": "expense-reimbursement"
      },
      "evidenceRequirements": [
        {
          "id": "receipt",
          "description": "An itemized receipt for the claimed expense.",
          "required": false,
          "kind": "document"
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "id": "reimbursement-policy",
          "title": "Expense reimbursement policy (experiment fixture)",
          "publisher": "Fixture",
          "publishedAt": "2026-09-05",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "uri",
            "value": "https://example.com/policies/expense-reimbursement"
          },
          "citation": {
            "location": "Whole policy",
            "excerpt": "A claim of 50 USD or less is approved. A claim above 50 USD is approved only when a receipt is attached; without one it is declined. Any claim above 1000 USD is escalated to finance instead of being decided."
          },
          "rights": "Synthetic policy text written for this experiment; not an operational policy."
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "approve",
          "label": "Approve",
          "description": "The claim may be reimbursed without a human deciding it."
        },
        {
          "id": "decline",
          "label": "Decline",
          "description": "The claim is refused because the policy's receipt condition is not met."
        }
      ],
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "small-claim",
          "description": "Approve a claim of 50 USD or less.",
          "when": {
            "op": "fact",
            "path": "/claim/amount",
            "operator": "less-than-or-equal",
            "value": "50"
          },
          "outcome": "approve",
          "onUnknown": "escalate",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "reimbursement-policy"
          ],
          "rationale": "The policy approves a claim of 50 USD or less outright."
        },
        {
          "id": "receipted-claim",
          "description": "Approve a claim above 50 USD when a receipt is attached.",
          "when": {
            "op": "all",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "op": "fact",
                "path": "/claim/amount",
                "operator": "greater-than",
                "value": "50"
              },
              {
                "op": "fact",
                "path": "/claim/receiptAttached",
                "operator": "equals",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "outcome": "approve",
          "onUnknown": "escalate",
          "evidenceRequirementRefs": [
            "receipt"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "reimbursement-policy"
          ],
          "rationale": "Above 50 USD the policy approves only a claim carrying a receipt."
        },
        {
          "id": "unreceipted-claim",
          "description": "Decline a claim above 50 USD with no receipt attached.",
          "when": {
            "op": "all",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "op": "fact",
                "path": "/claim/amount",
                "operator": "greater-than",
                "value": "50"
              },
              {
                "op": "fact",
                "path": "/claim/receiptAttached",
                "operator": "equals",
                "value": false
              }
            ]
          },
          "outcome": "decline",
          "onUnknown": "escalate",
          "evidenceRequirementRefs": [
            "receipt"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "reimbursement-policy"
          ],
          "rationale": "Above 50 USD a claim without a receipt is declined."
        }
      ],
      "exceptions": [
        {
          "id": "large-claim-to-finance",
          "description": "A claim above 1000 USD is escalated to finance instead of being decided here.",
          "when": {
            "op": "fact",
            "path": "/claim/amount",
            "operator": "greater-than",
            "value": "1000"
          },
          "effect": "escalate",
          "onUnknown": "escalate",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "reimbursement-policy"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "escalation": {
        "triggers": [
          "not-applicable",
          "missing-required-evidence",
          "unknown",
          "conflict",
          "no-match"
        ],
        "target": {
          "kind": "human-role",
          "name": "Finance"
        },
        "message": "Decide this expense reimbursement claim by hand: it is above the 1000 USD ceiling, or a fact the policy needs is missing."
      },
      "metadata": {
        "authors": [
          "judgment-pack framework experiment fixture"
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
        "license": "Apache-2.0"
      }
    },
    "unknowns": [
      "The policy fixes the thresholds in USD but does not say what to do with a claim denominated in another currency; the pack reads /claim/amount as a decimal string and assumes the caller has already converted it.",
      "\"above 50\" and \"above 1000\" are read as strictly greater-than, so a claim of exactly 1000.00 is decided here rather than escalated. The policy does not say.",
      "Whether a receipt is attached is supplied as the prepared fact /claim/receiptAttached. The pack declares a `receipt` evidence requirement as a citation only (required: false) \u2014 nothing in the pack checks that the attached document is itself a valid receipt."
    ]
  }
}
```
